# AI Agents — Architecture & Setup

## Overview
All AI agents are served as **FastAPI** applications. The C# backend calls them
over HTTP, with a subprocess fallback for the Task Guidance agent.

## Agents

| Agent | Module | Port | Endpoint |
|-------|--------|------|----------|
| Task Guidance | `agent2_task_guidance` | 5050 | `POST /api/guidance` |
| Progress Tracking | `agent3_progress_tracking` | 8003 | `POST /api/ai/progress-tracking` |

## Web.config Keys (per agent)

```xml
<!-- Agent: Task Guidance -->
<add key="AgentTaskGuidance" value="agent2_task_guidance" />
<add key="AgentTaskGuidanceUrl" value="http://localhost:5050/api/guidance" />

<!-- Agent: Progress Tracking -->
<add key="AgentProgressTracking" value="agent3_progress_tracking" />
<add key="AgentProgressTrackingUrl" value="http://localhost:8003/api/ai/progress-tracking" />
```

## How to Run

### Step 1: Install Python dependencies
```powershell
cd "d:\Personal\Courses\Agentic AI - NTI\Final Project\files\tasktune-agents"
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### Step 2: Start the Task Guidance Agent (FastAPI)
```powershell
cd "d:\Personal\Courses\Agentic AI - NTI\Final Project\files\tasktune-agents"
uvicorn agent2_task_guidance.server:app --reload --port 5050
```
> Server runs on **http://localhost:5050**
> Docs at **http://localhost:5050/docs**

### Step 3: Start the Progress Tracking Agent (FastAPI)
```powershell
cd "d:\Personal\Courses\Agentic AI - NTI\Final Project\files\tasktune-agents"
uvicorn agent3_progress_tracking.main:app --reload --port 8003
```
> Server runs on **http://localhost:8003**
> Docs at **http://localhost:8003/docs**

### Step 4: Rebuild & Start the C# Backend
Open the solution in **Visual Studio** and rebuild (Ctrl+Shift+B), then run (F5).

### Step 5: Start the Frontend
```powershell
cd "d:\Personal\Courses\Agentic AI - NTI\Final Project\files\tasktune-frontend"
npm run dev
```

## Architecture

```
Frontend (React)                    Backend (ASP.NET 4.8)              Agents (Python/FastAPI)
──────────────────                  ─────────────────────              ─────────────────────
TasksManagement.jsx                 TasksController.cs                 agent2: server.py (port 5050)
  │ "AI Recommend" button             │                                  │
  ├─ POST /api/tasks/recommend ──────►├─ HTTP ──────────────────────►  POST /api/guidance
  │                                   │                                  │
TaskDetails.jsx                       │                                  ├─ run_task_guidance()
  │ "Generate Guidance" button        │                                  │   (LangGraph pipeline)
  ├─ POST /api/tasks/{id}/           ├─ Strategy 1: HTTP ──────────►   │
  │   guidance/generate              │   (http://localhost:5050)        │
  │                                   ├─ Strategy 2: subprocess         │
  │                                   │   (fallback if HTTP fails)       │
  │◄─ JSON guidance response ◄───────┤◄─────────────────────────────────┘
  │                                   │
  └─ Renders in GuidanceSection       └─ Persists to AIActionsLog

                                                                       agent3: main.py (port 8003)
                                                                         │
                                      ├─ HTTP ──────────────────────►  POST /api/ai/progress-tracking
                                      │                                  │
                                      │◄─ JSON response ◄──────────────┘
```
